5
00:00:19,559 --> 00:00:24,840
A week later, in the afternoon, a number of dog carts drove up to the farm.

6
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:30,239
A deputation of neighboring farmers had been invited to make a tour of inspection.

7
00:00:30,239 --> 00:00:34,680
They were shown all over the farm and expressed great admiration for

8
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:39,319
