9
00:00:39,319 --> 00:00:42,399
The animals were weeding the turnip field.

10
00:00:42,399 --> 00:00:47,600
They worked diligently, hardly raising their faces from the ground, and not

11
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:52,879
knowing whether to be more frightened of the pigs or of the human visitors.

12
00:00:52,879 --> 00:00:57,719
That evening, loud laughter and bursts of singing came from the farmhouse.

13
00:00:57,719 --> 00:01:04,120
And suddenly, at the sound of the mingled voices, the animals were stricken with curiosity.

14
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:08,120
What could be happening in there now that for the first time animals and

15
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:12,479
